{"ref":"BDB, מִיכָאֵל","hw":"מִיכָאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָאֵל</span></big>  † <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָאֵל</span></big> <strong>n.pr.m. Michael</strong>, 𝔊 Μειχαηλ, Μιχαηλ <strong>(</strong><em>Who is like God?</em> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָיָהוּ</span>, and Assyrian proper names, as <em>Mannu-kî-Rammân</em>, ‘Who is like Rammân?’ <em>Mannu-kî-ilu-rabû</em>, ‘Who is like the great God?’ Dl<sup>Prol. 210; HWB 419</sup>; Schr<sup>COT 478</sup>; cf. Cook<sup>Aramaic Gloss. 74</sup><strong>)</strong>:—<br/><br><strong>1.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:13\" href=\"/Numbers.13.13\">Nu 13:13</a> (P).<br/><br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.13\">1 Ch 5:13</a>.<br/><br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.14\">5:14</a>.<br/><br><strong>4.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.25\">6:25</a>.<br/><br><strong>5.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.3\">7:3</a>.<br/><br><strong>6.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.16\">8:16</a>.<br/><br><strong>7.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.21\">12:21</a>.<br/><br><strong>8.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.18\">27:18</a>.<br/><br><strong>9.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.2\">2 Ch 21:2</a>.<br><strong>10.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:8\" href=\"/Ezra.8.8\">Ezr 8:8</a>.<br><strong>11.</strong>  the ‘prince,’ or patron-angel, of Israel, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:13\" href=\"/Daniel.10.13\">Dn 10:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:21\" href=\"/Daniel.10.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:1\" href=\"/Daniel.12.1\">12:1</a> (cf. Jude 9 Rev 12:7; Levy<sup>NHWB iii, 100</sup>).","next":"BDB, מִיכָיָ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, מִי"}